\section{RL Robustness}
\label{app:rl}

We evaluate DIF stability when reasoning-RL models (GRPO/PPO-trained) are added to the focal cohort.
Table~\ref{tab:rl-stability} shows DIF C\% changes minimally: from 31.3\% (SFT-only baseline) to 30.8\% when 13 reasoning-RL models are mixed into the 820-model focal cohort.
Jaccard similarity between flagged item sets remains $\geq$0.92, and TOST equivalence testing (margin\,=\,0.05) confirms non-degradation ($p$\,=\,0.003).

