Table~\ref{tab:dvd} shows DVD performs better on variant contamination (AUROC\,=\,0.74) than verbatim (AUROC\,=\,0.61), because variant contamination produces bimodal generation variance.
FPR is 0.065.
The 68 GPU-hours computational cost contrasts with DIF's zero-GPU design.

